      <article class="msg">
        <img class="msg__avatar" src="../../kit/assets/marks/mark-007.webp" alt="">
        <div class="msg__body">
          <p class="bubble" data-bubble>本周共 14 笔退款申请，12 笔与支付流水一致</p>
          <div class="cht-fail" data-fail><span class="tag" data-tone="danger">生成中断</span><button class="btn btn--secondary btn--sm" data-retry>重试</button></div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>

<article class="demo" data-cid="AP-CHAT-015" data-name="历史会话行" data-cat="CHAT">
  <div class="demo__head"><span class="demo__name">历史会话行</span></div>
