      <div class="row" role="option" tabindex="0" aria-selected="false" data-n="库存盘点"><img class="row__lead" src="../../kit/assets/marks/mark-015.webp" alt=""><div class="row__main"><p class="row__title one-line">库存盘点</p><p class="row__meta one-line">6 个商品低于安全线</p></div><div class="row__trail"><span>昨天</span></div></div>
      <div class="row" role="option" tabindex="0" aria-selected="false" data-n="退款汇总"><img class="row__lead" src="../../kit/assets/marks/mark-018.webp" alt=""><div class="row__main"><p class="row__title one-line">退款汇总</p><p class="row__meta one-line">本周共 14 笔退款申请</p></div><div class="row__trail"><span>昨天</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>

<article class="demo" data-cid="AP-CHAT-016" data-name="上下文用量条" data-cat="CHAT">
  <div class="demo__head"><span class="demo__name">上下文用量条</span></div>
  <p class="demo__note">适合：会话占用的上下文，接近上限转警告</p>
  <div class="demo__stage">
    <div class="card cht-card">
      <div class="cht-bar"><div class="cht-num"><b data-total>62%</b><span>已用</span></div><span class="tag" data-tone="success" data-tag>空间充足</span></div>
      <div class="cht-ctx" role="img" aria-label="上下文用量 62%"><i style="--w:38%;--c:var(--action)"></i><i style="--w:16%;--c:var(--accent)"></i><i style="--w:8%;--c:var(--info)"></i></div>
      <div class="cht-legend"><div><span><i style="--c:var(--action)"></i>对话</span><b data-v="0">38%</b></div><div><span><i style="--c:var(--accent)"></i>文件</span><b data-v="1">16%</b></div><div><span><i style="--c:var(--info)"></i>工具</span><b data-v="2">8%</b></div></div>
      <div class="cht-bar cht-bar--end"><button class="btn btn--secondary btn--sm" data-add>追加对话</button><button class="btn btn--ghost btn--sm" data-zip>压缩上下文</button></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>

<article class="demo" data-cid="AP-CHAT-017" data-name="生成中停止钮" data-cat="CHAT">
  <div class="demo__head"><span class="demo__name">生成中停止钮</span></div>
  <p class="demo__note">适合：发送钮在生成时变为停止，随时中断回答</p>
  <div class="demo__stage">
    <div class="cht-wrap cht-prompt">
      <div class="chat cht-chat" data-reply hidden>
        <div class="msg msg--user cht-in"><div class="bubble"><p data-ask></p></div></div>
        <article class="msg cht-in">
          <img class="msg__avatar" src="../../kit/assets/marks/mark-007.webp" alt="">
          <div class="msg__body"><p class="bubble" aria-live="polite"></p></div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <form class="prompt" data-form>
        <textarea rows="1" placeholder="输入消息" aria-label="输入消息" enterkeyhint="send"></textarea>
        <div class="prompt__bar">
          <span class="cht-run" data-run role="status"><span class="dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>生成中</span>
          <span class="tag" data-tag hidden></span>
          <span class="prompt__sp"></span>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary cht-stop" data-mode="send">发送</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>

<article class="demo" data-cid="AP-CHAT-018" data-name="对话加载骨架" data-cat="CHAT">
  <div class="demo__head"><span class="demo__name">对话加载骨架</span></div>
  <p class="demo__note">适合：会话历史加载时，保留消息的位置关系</p>
  <div class="demo__stage">
    <div class="cht-wrap">
      <div class="chat cht-chat" data-skel aria-busy="true" aria-label="消息加载中">
        <div class="skel" style="height:44px;width:58%;justify-self:end;border-radius:var(--r-xl)"></div>
        <div class="msg"><div class="skel cht-ava"></div><div class="msg__body"><div class="skel" style="height:44px"></div><div class="skel" style="height:16px;width:92%"></div><div class="skel" style="height:16px;width:70%"></div><div class="skel" style="height:64px"></div></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="chat cht-chat" data-real hidden>
        <div class="msg msg--user cht-in"><div class="bubble"><p>核对上周三家门店的对账差异</p></div></div>
        <article class="msg cht-in"><img class="msg__avatar" src="../../kit/assets/marks/mark-007.webp" alt=""><div class="msg__body"><p class="bubble">已比对三家门店 128 笔订单，发现 3 笔金额不一致。</p></div></article>
      </div>
      <div class="cht-bar cht-bar--end"><button class="btn btn--secondary btn--sm" data-toggle>载入消息</button></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>

<article class="demo" data-cid="AP-CHAT-019" data-name="附件标签条" data-cat="CHAT">
  <div class="demo__head"><span class="demo__name">附件标签条</span></div>
  <p class="demo__note">适合：输入栏里待发送的附件，可逐个移除</p>
  <div class="demo__stage">
    <div class="card cht-card">
      <div class="cht-files" data-files aria-label="已添加的附件"></div>
      <p class="cht-note" data-empty hidden>暂无附件</p>
      <div class="cht-bar cht-bar--end"><button class="btn btn--secondary btn--sm" data-add>添加附件</button></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>

<article class="demo" data-cid="AP-CHAT-020" data-name="消息操作条" data-cat="CHAT">
  <div class="demo__head"><span class="demo__name">消息操作条</span></div>
  <p class="demo__note">适合：回答下方的复制、重新生成与点赞按钮条</p>
  <div class="demo__stage">
    <div class="chat cht-chat">
      <article class="msg">
        <img class="msg__avatar" src="../../kit/assets/marks/mark-007.webp" alt="">
        <div class="msg__body">
          <p class="bubble" data-bubble>已比对三家门店 128 笔订单，发现 3 笔金额不一致，差额合计 286.50 元。</p>
          <div class="cht-ac-wrap">
            <div class="cht-ac" role="toolbar" aria-label="回答操作">
              <button class="cht-ac__btn" data-cp>复制</button>
              <button class="cht-ac__btn" data-regen>重新生成</button>
              <span class="cht-ac__sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <button class="cht-ac__btn" data-vote="up" aria-pressed="false">有用</button>
              <button class="cht-ac__btn" data-vote="down" aria-pressed="false" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="cht-ac-why">没用</button>
            </div>
            <div class="expand" id="cht-ac-why"><div>
              <div class="cht-ac__why" role="group" aria-label="不满意的原因"><button aria-pressed="false">不准确</button><button aria-pressed="false">不相关</button><button aria-pressed="false">太啰嗦</button><button aria-pressed="false">其他</button></div>
            </div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>

<article class="demo" data-cid="AP-CHAT-021" data-name="来源引用列表" data-cat="CHAT">
  <div class="demo__head"><span class="demo__name">来源引用列表</span></div>
  <p class="demo__note">适合：回答末尾可展开的参考来源列表</p>
  <div class="demo__stage">
    <div class="chat cht-chat cht-ref-wrap">
      <article class="msg">
        <img class="msg__avatar" src="../../kit/assets/marks/mark-007.webp" alt="">
        <div class="msg__body">
          <p class="bubble">已比对三家门店 128 笔订单<button class="cite" aria-label="来源 1 三家门店对账单" aria-pressed="false">1</button>，发现 3 笔金额不一致<button class="cite" aria-label="来源 2 订单明细" aria-pressed="false">2</button>，其中 2 笔为重复扣款<button class="cite" aria-label="来源 3 支付流水" aria-pressed="false">3</button>。</p>
          <div class="cht-ref">
            <button class="cht-ref__head" data-expand="cht-ref-1"><span class="cht-ref__stack" aria-hidden="true"><img src="../../kit/assets/solid/biz-review.webp" alt=""><img src="../../kit/assets/solid/order.webp" alt=""><img src="../../kit/assets/solid/bill.webp" alt=""></span><span>3 个参考来源</span><span class="chev" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
            <div class="expand" id="cht-ref-1"><div>
              <ol class="cht-ref__list" aria-label="参考来源">
                <li><button class="cht-ref__row" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="cht-ref-q1"><span class="cite" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="cht-ref__main"><span class="row__title one-line">三家门店对账单</span><span class="row__meta one-line">第 3 页</span></span><span class="chev" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><p class="cht-ref__quote" id="cht-ref-q1" hidden>三家门店本周共 128 笔订单，汇总金额 41,326.00 元。</p></li>
                <li><button class="cht-ref__row" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="cht-ref-q2"><span class="cite" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="cht-ref__main"><span class="row__title one-line">订单明细</span><span class="row__meta one-line">第 12 行</span></span><span class="chev" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><p class="cht-ref__quote" id="cht-ref-q2" hidden>单号 10321 与 10377 重复扣款，金额 128.00 元与 98.50 元。</p></li>
                <li><button class="cht-ref__row" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="cht-ref-q3"><span class="cite" aria-hidden="true">3</span><span class="cht-ref__main"><span class="row__title one-line">支付流水</span><span class="row__meta one-line">第 40 行</span></span><span class="chev" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><p class="cht-ref__quote" id="cht-ref-q3" hidden>单号 10402 实收与订单金额相差 60.00 元。</p></li>
              </ol>
            </div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>

<article class="demo" data-cid="AP-CHAT-022" data-name="计划步骤卡" data-cat="CHAT">
  <div class="demo__head"><span class="demo__name">计划步骤卡</span></div>
  <p class="demo__note">适合：智能体先列出计划步骤并标注已完成与进行中</p>
  <div class="demo__stage">
    <div class="card cht-card cht-pl">
      <div class="cht-bar"><p class="card__title">处理重复扣款</p><span class="tag" data-tone="action" data-tag>进行中</span></div>
      <div class="cht-pl__sum"><div class="progress" role="img" aria-label="计划进度" data-bar><i style="--v:40%"></i></div><span class="cht-pl__cnt t-num"><span data-num>2</span> / 5</span></div>
      <ol class="cht-pl__list" aria-label="计划步骤">
        <li class="cht-pl__step" data-state="done" data-done="用时 3 秒" data-doing="正在读取对账单"><span class="cht-pl__dot" aria-hidden="true"><img class="cht-pl__ok" src="../../kit/assets/line/check.webp" alt=""><img class="cht-pl__no" src="../../kit/assets/line/close.webp" alt=""></span><div class="cht-pl__txt"><p class="cht-pl__name">读取三家门店对账单</p><p class="cht-pl__meta">用时 3 秒</p></div><span class="tag" data-tone="success">已完成</span></li>
        <li class="cht-pl__step" data-state="done" data-done="用时 6 秒" data-doing="正在比对 128 笔订单"><span class="cht-pl__dot" aria-hidden="true"><img class="cht-pl__ok" src="../../kit/assets/line/check.webp" alt=""><img class="cht-pl__no" src="../../kit/assets/line/close.webp" alt=""></span><div class="cht-pl__txt"><p class="cht-pl__name">逐笔比对订单金额</p><p class="cht-pl__meta">用时 6 秒</p></div><span class="tag" data-tone="success">已完成</span></li>
        <li class="cht-pl__step" data-state="now" data-done="标出 2 笔重复扣款" data-doing="已标出 1 笔重复扣款"><span class="cht-pl__dot" aria-hidden="true"><img class="cht-pl__ok" src="../../kit/assets/line/check.webp" alt=""><img class="cht-pl__no" src="../../kit/assets/line/close.webp" alt=""></span><div class="cht-pl__txt"><p class="cht-pl__name">标出重复扣款订单</p><p class="cht-pl__meta">已标出 1 笔重复扣款</p></div><span class="tag" data-tone="action">进行中</span></li>
        <li class="cht-pl__step" data-state="wait" data-done="已通知 3 家门店" data-doing="正在发送通知" data-fail="建国路店暂时无法联系"><span class="cht-pl__dot" aria-hidden="true"><img class="cht-pl__ok" src="../../kit/assets/line/check.webp" alt=""><img class="cht-pl__no" src="../../kit/assets/line/close.webp" alt=""></span><div class="cht-pl__txt"><p class="cht-pl__name">通知三家门店核对</p><p class="cht-pl__meta" hidden></p></div><span class="tag">待开始</span></li>
        <li class="cht-pl__step" data-state="wait" data-done="已回写 128 笔订单" data-doing="正在回写订单"><span class="cht-pl__dot" aria-hidden="true"><img class="cht-pl__ok" src="../../kit/assets/line/check.webp" alt=""><img class="cht-pl__no" src="../../kit/assets/line/close.webp" alt=""></span><div class="cht-pl__txt"><p class="cht-pl__name">回写订单状态</p><p class="cht-pl__meta" hidden></p></div><span class="tag">待开始</span></li>
      </ol>
      <div class="cht-bar cht-bar--end"><button class="btn btn--ghost btn--sm" data-reset>重置</button><button class="btn btn--secondary btn--sm" data-next>下一步</button></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>

<article class="demo" data-cid="AP-CHAT-023" data-name="澄清问答卡" data-cat="CHAT">
  <div class="demo__head"><span class="demo__name">澄清问答卡</span></div>
  <p class="demo__note">适合：逐题提问，支持单选、多选、填写与跳过</p>
  <div class="demo__stage">
    <div class="cht-wrap">
      <div class="approval cht-qa">
        <div class="cht-qa__prog" aria-hidden="true"><i data-s="now"></i><i></i><i></i></div>
        <div class="cht-qa__body" data-body>
          <div class="cht-bar"><span class="cht-qa__pos" data-pos>第 1 题 共 3 题</span><span class="tag" data-kind>单选</span></div>
          <section data-q="0">
            <p class="approval__q" id="cht-qa-t0">选择对账时间段</p>
            <div class="approval__opts" role="radiogroup" aria-labelledby="cht-qa-t0">
              <button type="button" class="opt" role="radio" aria-checked="false"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><img src="../../kit/assets/line/check.webp" alt=""></span>上周</button>
              <button type="button" class="opt" role="radio" aria-checked="false"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><img src="../../kit/assets/line/check.webp" alt=""></span>本月</button>
              <button type="button" class="opt" role="radio" aria-checked="false"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><img src="../../kit/assets/line/check.webp" alt=""></span>本季度</button>
            </div>
          </section>
          <section data-q="1" hidden>
            <p class="approval__q" id="cht-qa-t1">选择需要核对的门店</p>
            <div class="approval__opts" role="group" aria-labelledby="cht-qa-t1">
              <div class="opt" role="checkbox" aria-checked="false"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><img src="../../kit/assets/line/check.webp" alt=""></span>建国路店</div>
              <div class="opt" role="checkbox" aria-checked="false"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><img src="../../kit/assets/line/check.webp" alt=""></span>徐汇滨江店</div>
              <div class="opt" role="checkbox" aria-checked="false"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><img src="../../kit/assets/line/check.webp" alt=""></span>浦东世纪店</div>
            </div>
          </section>
          <section data-q="2" hidden>
            <p class="approval__q" id="cht-qa-t2">补充其他要求</p>
            <textarea class="textarea" rows="3" aria-labelledby="cht-qa-t2" placeholder="选填"></textarea>
          </section>
          <div class="cht-qa__foot"><button type="button" class="btn btn--text" data-skip>跳过</button><span class="cht-qa__sp"></span><button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost" data-prev hidden>上一题</button><button type="button" class="btn btn--primary" data-next disabled>下一题</button></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cht-qa__done" data-sum hidden>
          <div class="cht-bar"><p class="approval__q">已提交回答</p><span class="tag" data-tone="success">已提交</span></div>
          <dl class="cht-qa__list" data-list></dl>
          <div class="cht-bar cht-bar--end"><button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost btn--sm" data-redo>重新回答</button></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>

<article class="demo" data-cid="AP-CHAT-024" data-name="对话代码块" data-cat="CHAT">
  <div class="demo__head"><span class="demo__name">对话代码块</span></div>
  <p class="demo__note">适合：回答中的配置或代码片段，带复制按钮</p>
  <div class="demo__stage">
    <div class="cht-cd" role="region" aria-label="对账配置">
      <div class="cht-cd__bar"><span class="cht-cd__name">对账配置</span><button class="btn btn--text btn--sm" data-cp>复制</button></div>
      <pre class="cht-cd__pre" id="cht-cd-pre" data-open="false" style="--n:13" tabindex="0" aria-label="配置内容，可左右滑动"><code>
<span class="cht-cd__ln" style="--d:0"><span class="cht-cd__t"><span class="k">对账配置</span>：</span></span>
<span class="cht-cd__ln" style="--d:1"><span class="cht-cd__t"><span class="k">范围</span>：<span class="v">上周</span></span></span>
<span class="cht-cd__ln" style="--d:1"><span class="cht-cd__t"><span class="k">门店</span>：</span></span>
<span class="cht-cd__ln" style="--d:2"><span class="cht-cd__t"><span class="d">-</span> <span class="v">建国路店</span></span></span>
<span class="cht-cd__ln" style="--d:2"><span class="cht-cd__t"><span class="d">-</span> <span class="v">徐汇滨江店</span></span></span>
<span class="cht-cd__ln" style="--d:2"><span class="cht-cd__t"><span class="d">-</span> <span class="v">浦东世纪店</span></span></span>
<span class="cht-cd__ln" style="--d:1"><span class="cht-cd__t"><span class="k">差异阈值</span>：<span class="n">0.01</span> <span class="v">元</span></span></span>
<span class="cht-cd__ln" style="--d:1"><span class="cht-cd__t"><span class="k">重复扣款</span>：<span class="v">自动标记</span></span></span>
<span class="cht-cd__ln" style="--d:1"><span class="cht-cd__t"><span class="k">通知</span>：</span></span>
<span class="cht-cd__ln" style="--d:2"><span class="cht-cd__t"><span class="k">方式</span>：<span class="v">站内消息</span></span></span>
<span class="cht-cd__ln" style="--d:2"><span class="cht-cd__t"><span class="k">对象</span>：<span class="v">店长</span></span></span>
<span class="cht-cd__ln" style="--d:1"><span class="cht-cd__t"><span class="k">汇总文件</span>：<span class="v">对账结果表，按门店分页并附差异明细与重复扣款标记</span></span></span>
<span class="cht-cd__ln" style="--d:1"><span class="cht-cd__t"><span class="k">保留天数</span>：<span class="n">90</span> <span class="v">天</span></span></span>
</code></pre>
      <button class="cht-cd__more" data-more aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="cht-cd-pre">展开全部 13 行</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>

